      "readme": "Oliva Mapping Hand Function Imaging Neuroscience 2025\n\n\nData includes:\n\n- Anatomical brain-extracted T1w image\n- Functional brain data for Finger Tapping and Force Matching tasks\n- Anatomical defaced T2w spinal cord image\n- Functional spinal cord data for Finger Tapping and Force Matching tasks\n\n\tIn derivatives/labels:\t\n\t- Anatomical T2w spinal cord image registered to PAM50 template\n\t- Segmentation of spinal cord functional images (Finger Tapping and Force Matching tasks)\n\n\tIn derivatives/physio:\n\t- Raw and processed physio files (cardiac pulse and respiration)\n\n\nNote: \n\n- The following subjects completed the tasks in two separate days due to technical issues: sub-NSPilot006, sub-NSPilot014\n- Task regressors are shared in GitHub at the following link: https://github.com/NeuromuscularInsightLab/Oliva_Mapping_Hand_Functon_Imaging_Neuroscience_2025/tree/main/trialwise_analysis\n",
